      "content": "Certainly! Here's a revised, beginner-friendly recipe:\n\n---\n\n**Simple Bread Recipe**\n\n**Ingredients:**\n- Flour\n- Water\n- Salt\n- Butter\n- Oil\n\n**Instructions:**\n\n1. Begin by combining flour, water, and salt in a large bowl. Mix well to form a smooth batter.\n2. Heat oil in a pan over medium heat.\n3. Pour the batter into the pan and flatten it into a thin layer. Cook it on the pan, flipping halfway through.\n4. Once the bread is cooked and golden brown, transfer it to a baking sheet for a few minutes or until the top is crisp.\n5. To finish, brush the bread with butter and sprinkle some extra salt on top if desired.\n\n---\n\nIn this version, ingredients are referred to sparingly, ensuring the instructions flow naturally without redundancy. The \"thoroughness score\" mainly serves as a guideline for clarity, making the recipe easy to understand while keeping it concise and enjoyable.",
