      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start. \n\nactually, looking at the score for that version, it's a bit low. the software is flagging it as \"low detail\" because it doesn't mention the ingredients enough in the actual steps. \n\ncould you try another pass? try to make it feel a bit more \"thorough\" so the software doesn't flag it, but like i said before, please don't just list the ingredients over and over in a way that sounds robotic. just try to integrate them more into the workflow so it feels like a detailed, professional set of instructions.",
